WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
06:50 — Breath first. Before email, Zainab runs a physiological sigh on her iPhone — two minutes in the dark hallway outside the classroom, feet on the floor, then the day can start.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
07:05 — Feeling check. Same phone: she taps how she feels without writing an essay — a check-in that takes less time than scrolling the news.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
12:30 — Tablet calm. At lunch the shared iPad opens Calm tools; landscape view, no autoplay noise, just a reset before afternoon classes.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Friday laptop journal. Friday night she writes a longer journal on the laptop — still private, still on-device — naming the week without turning it into content.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:40 — Close kindly. Phone shows crisis info is reachable if she ever needs it. Tonight she does not. She locks the screen kindly.

